      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:94660b7b5e3013253f7061ff872e7e593f5f5a40f139eda03304dfea32c56279\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:74edf7c0481a48dcffa0eae7611f4f1e7383268781811323e56a9b935b34e79b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:613bcd461c24b5fa95dcbfac45ddfeac50417b3350743d865baaf4cc260e7858\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"defined_terms\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1271,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1271,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A4d53ee5bb82b4562bf890b41c6bf9c154ada3917edc5705a3a91d12a43964493:685:1271:sha256-7c8d521b077281b12ae409287e62fb650e0188aaf31be1fcd52bef072cbdd8eb\",\"quote\":\"(b) Implementation —(1) How do I decide if a case meets one or more of the general recording criteria? A work-related injury or illness must be recorded if it results in one or more of the following:\\n\\n(i) Death. See § 1904.7(b)(2).\\n\\n(ii) Days away from work. See § 1904.7(b)(3).\\n\\n(iii) Restricted work or transfer to another job. See § 1904.7(b)(4).\\n\\n(iv) Medical treatment beyond first aid. See § 1904.7(b)(5).\\n\\n(v) Loss of consciousness. See § 1904.7(b)(6).\\n\\n(vi) A significant injury or illness diagnosed by a physician or other licensed health care professional. See § 1904.7(b)(7).\",\"start\":685}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:5db90a4f7ea84d9aa0e08df085a2b84f8fbfad1a8669c68bdfc3817bad4c700e\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:613bcd461c24b5fa95dcbfac45ddfeac50417b3350743d865baaf4cc260e7858\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:6f4ec0802587ef8b658a0262b9febfd0613ded0fab8c88237fbdeb47f84e9c28\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) Implementation —(1) How do I decide if a case meets one or more of the general recording criteria? A work-related injury or illness must be recorded if it results in one or more of the following:\\n\\n(i) Death. See § 1904.7(b)(2).\\n\\n(ii) Days away from work. See § 1904.7(b)(3).\\n\\n(iii) Restricted work or transfer to another job. See § 1904.7(b)(4).\\n\\n(iv) Medical treatment beyond first aid. See § 1904.7(b)(5).\\n\\n(v) Loss of consciousness. See § 1904.7(b)(6).\\n\\n(vi) A significant injury or illness diagnosed by a physician or other licensed health care professional. See § 1904.7(b)(7).\",\"references\":[\"§ 1904.7(b)(2)\",\"§ 1904.7(b)(3)\",\"§ 1904.7(b)(4)\",\"§ 1904.7(b)(5)\",\"§ 1904.7(b)(6)\",\"§ 1904.7(b)(7)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:3179b5a55948138d6c169391dc602731d3308d1e48be130804bded1e6d07f0d9\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":685,\"summary\":\"A work-related injury or illness must be recorded if it results in one or more of the following: death; days away from work; restricted work or transfer to another job; medical treatment beyond first aid; loss of consciousness; or a significant injury or illness diagnosed by a physician or other licensed health care professional.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
