      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"You\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:9475e2abf4f7dec101deddaf33dc565e917f8eb0d742cf9649b9df8115dd36c0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:eaf6b0743d4176ef130b93ff3bb02ed5358eeea8dc6f9a0131b8489aea74f7e6\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f52438e492565d67228975eba856e3a2428ea69024f735c0535d66738af607e9\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c5bad95d20a6350b9ccffff3832e722c4f044ed202554191ad00380981f1a565\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"defined_terms\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1615,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1615,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A4d53ee5bb82b4562bf890b41c6bf9c154ada3917edc5705a3a91d12a43964493:1273:1615:sha256-95feebdfdc8f5f37918c69eb0f079f013ef740173f51ba1c889ed0fcf30dcdc1\",\"quote\":\"(2) How do I record a work-related injury or illness that results in the employee's death? You must record an injury or illness that results in death by entering a check mark on the OSHA 300 Log in the space for cases resulting in death. You must also report any work-related fatality to OSHA within eight (8) hours, as required by § 1904.39.\",\"start\":1273}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:3bd7c465ff01ccfbbfcc8055ad115e6409bb630f8f596f3decc1c36604ad6302\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c5bad95d20a6350b9ccffff3832e722c4f044ed202554191ad00380981f1a565\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:f1be3b038b0f6bb77dccd1e1698187d649bde67ebd43275f2e34eb40cf06a64a\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(