      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "If you inquire about a vague restriction and the physician or other licensed health care professional answers 'Yes' to whether the employee can do all routine job functions and work all normally assigned work shift, the case does not involve a work restriction and does not have to be recorded as such.",
