        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"you\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"summary\":\"If you receive recommendations from two or more physicians or other licensed health care professionals regarding a job restriction, you may make a decision as to which recommendation is the most authoritative, and record the case based upon that recommendation.\"}",
