ef of heat stress.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:term:699afc599efce20448012df8aefeddd76455fe2bf6fa86414f457ea98d9f0dcf\"],\"typed_values\":[]}",
