        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(6) Is every work-related injury or illness case involving a loss of consciousness recordable? Yes, you must record a work-related injury or illness if the worker becomes unconscious, regardless of the length of time the employee remains unconscious."
        },
